        "Description": "This is a challenges contract. You MUST get the keys to the quad bike. You MUST collect 10 apricots. You MUST get the hallucinogenic drug from Ezra Berg&apos;s shed. On the 2nd floor of the house, feed the apricots to the blue dragon, WITHOUT being spotted. Exit the mission via the quad bike. SURPRISE............This is a FUN mission, so have FUN.\r\rCreator: Ozzygrl",
